WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.571
Since 2022 I've worked at Crol,

2
00:00:02.571 --> 00:00:05.640
a cloud ERP for businesses in Mexico.

3
00:00:05.640 --> 00:00:08.844
I started on Conto Pay, a much simpler,

4
00:00:08.844 --> 00:00:11.802
easier version of Crol: its web app,

5
00:00:11.802 --> 00:00:14.760
its landing page and its mobile app.

6
00:00:14.760 --> 00:00:19.136
And that same app became the base for Crol ERP Móvil,

7
00:00:19.136 --> 00:00:22.438
which I built and designed from scratch.
